control: The Redaction Gate releases a body only for a sender the policy does not restrict, with no content flag, scanned or skipped by the scan gate
removes: only a sender a rule lists is restricted, so an unreadable address and a policy that never loaded are released
packages: ./core/redact
tests: TestFailClosed/a_policy_that_never_loaded TestFailClosed/a_sender_the_classifier_cannot_read TestFailClosed/a_sender_with_no_registrable_domain
scheduled-count: no
